      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>scale of it all just makes \"small actions\" feel like a joke. it feels more like being told to rearrange deck chairs on the titanic. like, why even bother building a life, or finding a career, or having kids, if the whole system is just going to collapse under the weight of it all? it feels futile to invest so much energy into a world that's basically doomed.",
